{"id":"wb-6-54","name":"苏密城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"苏密城","text":"苏密城位于中国吉林省桦甸市东，为渤海国长岭府治所遗址。\n\n苏密城为渤海国时期长岭府的治所所在地。“苏密”一词有说法为“粟末”的音转，而正是位于粟末水的粟末靺鞨建立了渤海国。\n\n遗址呈回字形，坐南朝北。城垣版筑，分内外二城，外城高4米，宽2-3米，周长2590米，设四门，建瓮城，城外有护城河。内城高3-4米，周长1399米，东、西各辟一门。遗址出土有瓦当、陶片等遗物，其中瓦当多为四瓣形制。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%8F%E5%AF%86%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":92035328,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92035328","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/50832b640a6699b76964bd54.jpg","title":"苏密城残墙和入口_行摄梓地_20110828065416.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8B%8F%E5%AF%86%E5%9F%8E%E6%AE%8B%E5%A2%99%E5%92%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3_%E8%A1%8C%E6%91%84%E6%A2%93%E5%9C%B0_20110828065416.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/%E8%8B%8F%E5%AF%86%E5%9F%8E%E6%AE%8B%E5%A2%99%E5%92%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3_%E8%A1%8C%E6%91%84%E6%A2%93%E5%9C%B0_20110828065416.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"梓地","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​苏密城残墙和入口","width":320,"height":198},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}